cinnamon-clipboard (1.0.4-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Release Cinnamon Clipboard 1.0.4 for Ubuntu Noble.
  * Disable the in-app updater for APT-managed installations.
  * Add translations for the APT update-management notice.
  * Add an option to paste an item automatically when selected.
  * Focus the first line when opening the menu.
  * Improve keyboard navigation.

